command-description-token-add = Gives an item to the piped players.
command-description-token-remove = Removes the piped items from their owner's inventory.
command-description-token-dump = Dump the piped tokens to the console.
command-description-token-inv = Get all tokens in the piped player's inventory.

command-description-currencystore-transfer = Transfers the piped tokens to the specified player.
command-description-currencystore-activate = Activates a token on it's owner.
